.env
jobs.db
jobs.db-wal
jobs.db-shm
# The copy taken before a factory reset carries every row that was wiped - same personal data as the
# live file, so it is ignored by the same rule rather than by a filename nobody remembers to add.
jobs.db.backup-*
browser_sessions/
generated_resumes/
social_posts/
source_resumes/
projects/
__pycache__/
.venv/
# Full-page capture of someone else's LinkedIn profile, written only when outreach misses. Personal
# data about a third party - diagnose from it locally, never commit it.
linkedin_*.png
# The audit report is regenerated by `python audit_check.py` and quotes this machine: the live root
# path, the hostnames of every ATS session on file, and the queue's own company names. It is an
# artifact, not source - rerun the audit instead of committing the last one.
audit_report.md
# A private plan, not part of the project. Take the line out if it should ship.
SAAS_ROADMAP.md
interviews/
.claude/
*.log
